{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段驚險車Cam片段，顯示大埔公路發生一宗七人車撞壆意外。事發於今日（16 日）早上 8 時 55 分，一輛掛有兩地牌的七人車沿大埔公路往大埔方向行駛，當駛至沙田馬場對開時突告失事撞壆。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-16h29m07s901.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026k0r91yT7XP1789547682.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-16h29m07s901.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段顯示，涉事兩地牌七人車原本沿大埔公路中線行駛，駛至沙田馬場對開時，七人車由中線向左切線。惟七人車切線期間突然衝上分叉路壆，更直接撞倒一個路牌，現場隨即揚起大量沙塵，七人車在撞擊後繼續衝前數米始停下。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-16h29m10s242.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026J1fQqFtZ1O1789547697.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-16h29m10s242.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方證實，今日早上8時55分接獲報案，一輛七人車沿大埔公路往大埔方向行駛至沙田馬場對開時失事撞壆，意外中無人受傷，警方目前正調查事故確切起因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T08:59:32.650756+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}